<title>USA: Oakley Inc buys UK distributor.</title>
<headline>Oakley Inc buys UK distributor.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oakley Inc said it has agreed to buy Serval Marketing, its exclusive distributor for the United Kingdom and Ireland, and will rename it Oakley UK.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Based outside London, Serval Marketing has been the exclusive distributor of Oakley products to the UK and Ireland for more than 15 years, the company said.</p>
</text>
